            <p>A friend of mine was given months to live. Traditional treatments hadn't worked. Then he heard about CAR-T therapy in China. Last month, his follow-up scans showed the tumors had shrunk.</p>

            <p>Stories like this used to be about trips to the US. Not anymore.</p>
