        <p>Ten years ago, if you said "I'm going to China for medical treatment," people would think you were joking. That's changed.</p>

        <h3>CAR-T Cell Therapy: A Game Changer</h3>

        <p>CAR-T therapy is a prime example of China's medical breakthroughs. Simply put, doctors extract your blood, modify your immune cells to attack cancer, then reinfuse them. Hospitals in Wuhan, Shanghai, and Beijing have completed thousands of treatments. The results for blood cancers—leukemia, lymphoma, myeloma—have been impressive.</p>

